  "description": "Native rules for Skill Lab champions. Isliid now controls seven independent swords, accumulates colored engravings, supports allies and predicts formations by mastery. Also includes the Coder (100 functions in 13 languages, scripts and daemons, his rig up to a data center, AI ult and Bitcoin shop), Aegis Zero, Levi, Flash, farming skills and Mod Power. Unified: Einstein, Newton and Marie Curie share 18 equations on five charges; reserve any skill as a trait of the next cast for combos of up to five steps, 36 named signatures and 6 Unifications, ranked by mastery. Vesper and the Rift Gauntlets: pure orbs (5, overload to 9) and Hextech hexorbs open any of 200 dimensions for rift punches, swipes and tears; Shatter, gauntlet breaks and an evolving Hexcore; mastery changes only her planning. Magnus: eleven ranked Slim A appearances, actual calculation previews, compact Alchemist pieces, an ultimate-gated 32,000-unit grid, persistent field armies, cardinal pawns and checkmate planning. Vesper retains every animation pixel while using lossless packed atlases and opt-in per-owner performance timings. Practical grandmaster planning uses observed motion and counterplay; native farming preserves major skills and escape tools; Chess Lab v4 reports damage receipt status. Frieren uses mana, quick and charged Spellcraft (target warned), barriers and targetable party support. Magnus re-plans at most every 0.2 s after a fruitless search. Native farming uses assigned roles and active objective assistance. Gojo uses one authoritative Six Eyes/CE/strain controller, earned Black Flash and one allied Domain guest. Universal team intentions and four persistent athlete game-sense ratings; role-aware farming observations. Creative Herobrine has 45 catalogue entries, HP Tank Steve scaling and paid redstone networks. Frieren/Coder/Dio balance reductions and rooted 75000-range Omen Shadow Step. Objective HP and growth double once per career through a recoverable settings migration. Targetable Stark restores warned ultimate leaps. Callback-local query batching and lossless Frieren atlases preserve combat and animation detail.",
